  "description": "Variation of condition 21 (Floorspace) of planning permission ref. 19/01531/FUL (Use of the ground floor of Block B for flexible uses B1, A1-A4, D1, D2 uses (1,017 sqm) and use of the ground floor of Block C for flexible uses B1, A1-A4, D1, D2 uses (396 sqm) and use of the Basement -1 level for flexible uses comprising B1, A1-A4, D1, D2 uses (5,922 sqm).) Granted on: 11/02/2021\r\rVariation sought:\tTo amend Condition 21 to remove the requirement for a minimum quantum of office floorspace on the site and therefore to delete the last sentence of the Condition, which states the following:\r\r\"Notwithstanding the GIAs for the uses hereby permitted a minimum of 1457sqm of Class B1 floorspace shall be provided on site.\"",
